    "text": "3 KALENDAS IVLII PASSIO APOSTOLORVM PETRI ET PAVLI Uenit iesus in partes\nMatheus se godspellere awrat on \u00fe\u00e6re godspellican gesetnysse. \u00feus cwe\u00feende;\nDrihten com to anre burhscire \u00fee is gehaten cesarea philippi. and befran his gingran hu menn be\nHi andwyrdon;\nSume menn cwe\u00fea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u sy iohannes se fulluhtere: sume secga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u sy helias. sume\nSe H\u00e6lend \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0. hw\u00e6t secge ge \u00fe\u00e6t ic sy? Petrus him andwyrde. \u00feu eart crist \u00fe\u00e6s lyfiendan\nDrihten him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to andsware;\nEadig eart \u00feu simon culfran bearn. for \u00fean \u00fee fl\u00e6sc and blod \u00fee ne onwreah \u00feysne geleafan. ac min\nIc \u00f0e secge \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u eart st\u00e6nen. and ofer \u00feysne stan ic getimbrie mine cyrcan. and hellegatu naht ne\nIc bet\u00e6ce \u00fee heofenan rices c\u00e6ge. and swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu bintst on eor\u00fean. \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 gebunden on\nAnd swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu unbinst ofer eor\u00fean. \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 unbunden on heofenum;\nBeda se trahtnere us onwrih\u00f0 \u00fea deopnysse \u00feysre r\u00e6dinge and cwy\u00f0. \u00fe\u00e6t philippus se fe\u00feerrica \u00fea\n\u00d0a \u00f0a se h\u00e6lend to \u00fe\u00e6re burhscire geneal\u00e6hte. \u00fea befran he hu woruldmen be him cwyddodon;\nNa swilce he nyste manna cwyddunga be him: ac he wolde mid so\u00fere andetnysse. \u00fe\u00e6s rihtan\nHis apostoli him andwyrdon;\nSume menn cwyddia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u sy Iohannes se fulluhtere. sume secga\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feu sy helias sume\nDrihten \u00fea befran. hw\u00e6t secge ge \u00fe\u00e6t ic sy? swilce he swa cw\u00e6de. nu woruldmenn \u00feus dwollice\nHim andwyrde se gehyrsuma petrus: \u00feu eart crist \u00f0\u00e6s lifiendan godes sunu;\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s lifiendan godes: for tw\u00e6minge \u00fe\u00e6ra leasra goda: \u00fea \u00f0e h\u00e6\u00feene \u00feeoda mid mislicum\nSume hi gelyfdon on deadum entum. and him deorwur\u00felice anlicnyssa ar\u00e6rdon. and cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 se witega \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enre anlicnyssa synd gyldene and sylfrene manna handgeweorc:\nSume hi gelyfdon on \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan. sume on \u00feam monan. sume on fyre and on manegum o\u00ferum\nNu tod\u00e6lde petrus swutelice \u00feone so\u00f0an geleafan. \u00fea \u00f0a he cw\u00e6\u00f0. \u00feu eart crist \u00fe\u00e6s lifiendan godes\nOn \u00feysum \u00ferim hadum is an godcundnyss. and an gecynd and an weorc untod\u00e6ledlice;\nDrihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to petre: eadig eart \u00feu culfran sunu;\nSe halga gast w\u00e6s gesewen ofer criste on culfran anlicnysse;\nNu gecigde se h\u00e6lend petrum culfran bearn for \u00fean \u00f0e he w\u00e6s afylled mid bylewitnysse. and gife\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0. ne onwreah \u00fee fl\u00e6sc ne blod \u00feysne geleafan: ac min f\u00e6der se \u00fee on heofenum is;\nFl\u00e6sc and blod is gecweden his fl\u00e6sclice m\u00e6ig\u00f0;\nN\u00e6fde he \u00fe\u00e6t andgit \u00feurh m\u00e6iglicere lare. ac se heofenlica f\u00e6der \u00feurh \u00f0one halgan gast \u00feisne\nDrihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to petre. \u00feu eart st\u00e6nen;\nFor \u00fe\u00e6re strenc\u00fee his geleafan. and for anr\u00e6dnysse his andetnysse he underfeng \u00feone naman. for\nAnd ic timbrie mine cyrcan uppon \u00feysum stane \u00fe\u00e6t is ofer \u00feam geleafan \u00fee \u00f0u andetst;\nEall godes gela\u00f0ung is ofer \u00feam stane gebytlod \u00fe\u00e6t is ofer criste. for \u00fean \u00f0e he is se grundweal\nEalle godes cyrcan sind getealde to anre gela\u00f0unge: and seo is mid gecorenum mannum getimbrod.\nSe \u00fee bytla\u00f0 of \u00feam grundwealle his weorc hryst to micclum lyre;\nSe H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0. ne magon hellegatu naht togeanes minre cyrrcan;\nLeahtras and dwollic lar sind hellegatu for \u00fean \u00f0e hi l\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00feone synfullan swilce \u00feurh get into\nManega sind \u00fea gatu ac heora nan ne m\u00e6ig ongean \u00fe\u00e6re halgan gela\u00f0unge. \u00fee is getimbrod uppon\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0. ic \u00fee bet\u00e6ce heofenan rices c\u00e6ge;\nNis seo c\u00e6ig gylden ne sylfren ne of nanum antimbre gesim\u00f0od: ac is se anweald \u00fee him crist\nAnd swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu unbinst ofer eor\u00fean. \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 unbunden on heofenan;\n\u00d0isne anweald he forgeaf nu petre. and eac sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6r his upstige eallum his apostolum. \u00fea \u00f0a he\nOnfo\u00f0 haligne gast: \u00fe\u00e6ra manna synna \u00fee ge forgifa\u00f0 beo\u00f0 forgyfene: and \u00feam \u00f0e ge forgyfenysse\nNella\u00f0 \u00fea apostoli n\u00e6nne rihtwisne mid heora mansumunge gebindan. ne eac \u00feone manfullan\n\u00d0one ylcan anweald h\u00e6f\u00f0 se \u00e6lmihtiga geti\u00f0od biscopum. and halgum m\u00e6ssepreostum. gif hi hit\nAc for \u00fei is seo c\u00e6ig petre synderlice bet\u00e6ht. \u00fe\u00e6t eall \u00feeodscipe gleawlice tocnawe. \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwa\nDE PASSIONE APOSTOLORVM;\nWe wylla\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00feysum godspelle eow gereccan \u00fe\u00e6ra apostola drohtnunga: and geendunge mid\n\u00c6fter drihtnes upstie w\u00e6s petrus bodiende geleafan \u00feam leodscipum \u00fee sind gecwedene galatia.\nSy\u00f0\u00f0an ymbe tyn geara fyrst he gewende to romebyri bodiende godspel: and on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig he\nHis wi\u00feerwinna w\u00e6s on eallum his f\u00e6relde sum dry se w\u00e6s simon genemned;\n\u00d0es dry w\u00e6s mid \u00feam awyriedum gaste to \u00feam swi\u00f0e afylled \u00fe\u00e6t he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re crist\n\u00d0a gelamp hit \u00fe\u00e6t man ferede anre wydewan suna lic \u00fe\u00e6r petrus bodiende w\u00e6s;\nHe \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam folce and to \u00feam dry: geneal\u00e6ca\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re b\u00e6re. and gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0ess bodung so\u00f0\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea symon wear\u00f0 gebyld \u00feurh deofles gast. and cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nSwa hra\u00fee swa ic \u00feone deadan ar\u00e6re. acwella\u00f0 minne wi\u00f0erwinnan petrum;\n\u00d0\u00e6t folc him andwyrde: cucenne we hine forb\u00e6rna\u00f0;\nSimon \u00fea mid deofles cr\u00e6fte dyde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6s deadan lic styriende w\u00e6s;\n\u00dea wende \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t he geedcucod w\u00e6re;\nPetrus \u00fea ofer eal clypode. gif he geedcucod sy sprece to us: astande. onbyrige metes and ham\n\u00d0\u00e6t folc \u00fea hrymde. hluddre stemne. gif symon \u00feis ne de\u00f0. he sceal \u00fe\u00e6t wite \u00feolian \u00fee he \u00f0e\nSimon to \u00feysum wordum hine gebealh. and fleonde w\u00e6s. ac \u00fe\u00e6t folc mid orm\u00e6tum edwite hine\nSe godes apostol \u00fea geneal\u00e6hte \u00feam lice mid a\u00feenedum earmum \u00feus biddende;\n\u00d0u leofa drihten. \u00fee us sendest to bodienne \u00feinne geleafan. and us behete \u00fe\u00e6t we mihton \u00feurh\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum gebede aras se deada. and gebiggedum cneowum to petre cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nIc geseah h\u00e6lend crist and he sende his englas for \u00feinre bene \u00fe\u00e6t hi me to life gel\u00e6ddon;\n\u00d0\u00e6t folc \u00f0a mid anre stemne clypiende cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nAn god is \u00fee petrus boda\u00f0. and woldon forb\u00e6rnan \u00feone dry: ac petrus him forwyrnde: cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t se\nSymon \u00fea \u00f0a he \u00feam folce \u00e6twunden w\u00e6s. getigde \u00e6nne orm\u00e6tne ry\u00f0\u00f0an innon \u00feam gete \u00fe\u00e6r\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea petrus com and \u00feone ry\u00f0\u00f0an untigde mid \u00feysum bebode;\nYrn and sege symone \u00fe\u00e6t he leng mid his drycr\u00e6fte godes folc ne bep\u00e6ce: \u00fee he mid his agenum\nAnd he sona getengde. wi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s drys. and hine on fleame gebrohte;\nPetrus wear\u00f0 \u00e6fterweard \u00feus cwe\u00feende;\nOn godes naman ic \u00fee bebeode. \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u n\u00e6nne to\u00f0 on his lice ne gef\u00e6stnige;\nSe hund \u00fea \u00f0a he ne moste his lichaman derian. tot\u00e6r his h\u00e6teru sticm\u00e6lum of his b\u00e6ce. and hine\nHe \u00fea \u00e6tb\u00e6rst \u00feam hunde. and to langum fyrste sy\u00f0\u00f0an for \u00fe\u00e6re sceame n\u00e6s gesewen on romana\nSy\u00f0\u00f0an eft on fyrste he beget sumne \u00fee hine bespr\u00e6c to \u00feam casere. nerone: and gelamp \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t se\nMid \u00feam \u00fee hit \u00feus gedon w\u00e6s \u00fea \u00e6teowde crist hine sylfne petre on gastlicre gesih\u00fee: and mid\nSe dry simon. and se w\u00e6lhreowa nero sind mid deofles gaste afyllede. and syrwia\u00f0 ongean \u00f0e. ac\n\u00deis gelamp swa so\u00f0lice on \u00feone o\u00f0erne d\u00e6ig com paulus into \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. and heora \u00e6ig\u00feer o\u00feerne\nBeah \u00f0a ungerim folces to cristendome \u00feurh petres lare. and eac \u00fe\u00e6s caseres gebedda libia. and his\n\u00deurh paules bodunge gelyfdon \u00fe\u00e6s caseres \u00feegnas. and hiredcnihtas: and \u00e6fter heora fulluhte\nSymon se dry worhte \u00f0a \u00e6rene n\u00e6ddran styriende. swilce heo cucu w\u00e6re. and dyde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6rtogeanes geh\u00e6lde petrus blinde and healte. and deofolseoce. and \u00fea deadan ar\u00e6rde and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 \u00feis \u00f0am casere gecyd and he het \u00feone dry him to gefeccan and eac \u00fea apostolas;\nSymon br\u00e6d his hiw \u00e6tforan \u00feam casere swa \u00fe\u00e6t he wear\u00f0 f\u00e6rlice ge\u00feuht cnapa. and eft harwenge:\n\u00d0a nero \u00fe\u00e6t geseah. \u00fea wende he \u00fe\u00e6t he godes sunu w\u00e6re. petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he godes wi\u00f0ersaca\nSymon cw\u00e6\u00f0: Nis na gedafenlic \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u cyning hlyste anes leases fisceres wordum: ac ic \u00feysne\nPetrus cw\u00e6\u00f0. ne ondr\u00e6de ic \u00feine awyrigedan gastas: ac hi wur\u00f0a\u00f0 afyrhte \u00feurh mines drihtnes\nNero cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nNe ondr\u00e6dst \u00feu \u00f0e petrus symones mihta. \u00fee mid wundrum his g